<title>USA: CBOE to list options on Teleport.</title>
<headline>CBOE to list options on Teleport.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Chicago Board Options Exchange said Friday it would list options on Teleport Communications Group on October 4.</p>
<p>The exchange said the options would have introductory expirations in October, November, January and April. Initial strikes will be 22-1/2, 25 and 30.</p>
<p>The stock was unchanged at 24-1/8 Friday afternoon.</p>
<p>Teleport options will trade in the Storage Technology Corp trading crowd, the exchange said.</p>
<p>--Derivatives desk, (312) 408-8750</p>
<p>E-mail: derivatives@reuters.com</p>
